<title>CROATIA: Croat Podravka says in loan talks to cut costs.</title>
<headline>Croat Podravka says in loan talks to cut costs.</headline>
<byline>Kolumbina Bencevic</byline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Croatian food-processing group Podravka said on Tuesday it was negotiating a 60 million mark ($35.5 million) loan with Bayerische Vereinsbank in an effort to cut huge financing costs that had gnawed at its results for years.</p>
</text>
